   <narrative xml:lang="SV">2 International Foundation for Science (IFS) &#xE4;r en enskild organisation som grundades 1972 som svar p&#xE5; kompetensf&#xF6;rlust i utvecklingsl&#xE4;nderna. M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att b idra till st&#xE4;rkt forskningskapacitet i l&#xE5;ginkomstl&#xE4;nder genom att identifiera unga talangfulla forskare. St&#xF6;det &#xE4;r i huvudsak i form av utrustning,.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Foundation for Science (IFS) is a non-governmental organisation founded in 1972 as a response against brain-drain. The mission is to contribute to strengthening research capacity in low income countries by using the strategy to identify young talented scientists.The support is mainly in the form of equipment.</narrative>
